{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>賭王三房千金何超蓮向來生活富泰，日前她在社交平台分享最新Vlog，公開自己入住超豪華療養院的極奢華行程。由私人導師到頂級養生膳食均極盡享受，豪門級的療養生活隨即引起網民熱烈討論。</p><figure><img alt=\"何超蓮入住療養院。（小紅書＠何超蓮）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146834908061634560104682.png/LLTeR-n2qeD2r0UshhMKqSeEk7UR-2gs9J4gT_SeIE8\"/><figcaption>何超蓮入住療養院。（小紅書＠何超蓮）</figcaption></figure><p>星級私人導師全天候貼身指導</p><p>何超蓮入住的頂級療養院隱密度極高，她除了坐上吉普車獨享私人茶田美景外，療養院更為她安排了星級私人導師，全天候貼身指導她進行戶外排毒瑜伽以及高端普拉提運動，享受頂尖的健康待遇。</p><figure><img alt=\"何超蓮入住療養院。（小紅書＠何超蓮）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146836135960383488316957.png/aC8Qm0WOnCWWYpfwlIjNGxbrqBbXFbyU2V1dB9ldXQc\"/><figcaption>何超蓮入住療養院。（小紅書＠何超蓮）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何超蓮入住療養院。（小紅書＠何超蓮）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146836138347073536182965.png/aGuXmFW1d1yxP5HgXhc-z7Gf1o54Ca6LtA2t07QNrdM\"/><figcaption>何超蓮入住療養院。（小紅書＠何超蓮）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"超豪華度假村（小紅書＠何超蓮）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146834905553309696573109.png/WT48Xe-4z_020unf3BashVZV-SUt_3HChDjzdoQ483Y\"/><figcaption>超豪華度假村（小紅書＠何超蓮）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"做yoga（小紅書＠何超蓮）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146834903128870912761504.png/QQKoEVzKYeLs2vLetiey-GJPEFeupDeLfCscA3wrHAM\"/><figcaption>做yoga（小紅書＠何超蓮）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"pilates（小紅書＠何超蓮）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146834900725403648419578.png/NsY91615FP2kZSFbRR3Yje2OvS9DmCH5U6UdjVOlHY0\"/><figcaption>pilates（小紅書＠何超蓮）</figcaption></figure><p>除了運動，飲食方面的奢華度同樣驚人。何超蓮獲安排在私人廚房跟名廚上課，品嚐全有機原料製作的高級素宴，將富貴養生發揮到極致。</p><figure><img alt=\"專人指導煮有機素宴。（小紅書＠何超蓮）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146834897894117376048732.png/c5ALC83CY9DbYhgij7_ZN2bsoEedWJ4yRl3niUZd54k\"/><figcaption>專人指導煮有機素宴。（小紅書＠何超蓮）</figcaption></figure><p>住十億山頂豪宅辦半億婚禮</p><p>其實何超蓮的富貴日常早已不是新鮮事。她婚前和媽媽陳婉珍共住的布力徑山頂大宅市值高達10億港元，面積達8,000呎，內建私人花園、大型泳池及健身室。而她當年與竇驍在峇里島舉行的世紀夢幻婚禮，更豪砸逾5,000萬港元包辦全場，完美展現何家千金的非凡身家。</p><figure><img alt=\"何超蓮不時在家中開Party。（IG@laurinda_ho）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146837166437961728789016.jpeg/wYUhuHFfv2HcmzyGa09cU0WhD_FTprMFQ1lp6UNZaek\"/><figcaption>何超蓮不時在家中開Party。（IG@laurinda_ho）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"親自BBQ！（小紅書照片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146837277490548736406328.jpeg/kpqfYFvadqvddKRViLQ4XCYiVEI_aPSsgkT3OYJE9zk\"/><figcaption>親自BBQ！（小紅書照片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"泳池景！（小紅書照片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146837392997486592820675.jpeg/WAcrTjSwaBCLFOqrgaTE_YrGxKY6Q5JMuADWsbgA1rE\"/><figcaption>泳池景！（小紅書照片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"兩人舉辦盛大婚禮。（Instagram@laurinda_ho）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230425/727541342556655616741563.jpeg/HH6apWLDRd1EWQ1Df8nAad5dwha-Nl3QtpD1xLaQ9cQ\"/><figcaption>兩人舉辦盛大婚禮。（Instagram@laurinda_ho）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有愛。（Instagram@laurinda_ho）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230425/727541359318274048258031.jpeg/je_DX6MF4fgLb_7eHs6XM1xr2G22oSUqwRobeMEaG3g\"/><figcaption>有愛。（Instagram@laurinda_ho）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-25T13:39:12.066871+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":635,"images":12,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}